<h1>Building systems.<br/>Understanding what holds up.</h1>
<p class="lead">Notes on building, scaling, and operating systems in production — and the decisions behind them.</p>
<p>I'm a platform engineer and engineering leader based in Melbourne. My work brings together reliability, deployment, cost, and security. Here I write about the problems, trade-offs, and lessons that come with that responsibility.</p>
<figure class="fine-figure"><img src={`${base}its-fine-hero.png`} alt="An original illustration of a calm engineer beside a cloud systems dashboard with warning lights." /><figcaption>It's fine. Until it isn't. An original illustration for itsf9.dev.</figcaption></figure>
